# GitHub workflow

This repo lives on GitHub: `git@github.com:itsuppartem/artek-buddy.git` (`origin`, branch `main`).

## After a finished change

1. Bump the one product version when behavior ships (`VERSION`, `src/artek_buddy/__init__.py`, `client/VERSION`).
2. Update `README.md` in the same change: version, what a user can do, install example (`.deb` filename), compose/env if those changed.
3. Run `make test`. If the window changed, also `make test-ui`. If tests fail, do not commit.
3. Follow [precommit-hygiene.mdc](precommit-hygiene.mdc). Do not commit secrets.

## Do not commit

`.env`, tokens, `*.deb`, `data/`, `scripts/`, `docs/`, `docker-compose.local.yml`. Attribution of the adapted Rakazo contracts stays in `README.md` / `NOTICE` only. Do not present this repo as their TypeScript port.

## Language

Commit messages and repo docs stay English. Chat with the user may stay in their language.
